        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at regional storage
Shares of production in the US (25%) and imports from China (9%) and Asia and Pacific (66%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 2a0537e7-c719-3472-87fe-c9df59fd712c
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon cells used in photovoltaic module production in the US and other American countries. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2a0537e7-c719-3472-87fe-c9df59fd712c.xml</text>
